# Errors

## AMBIGUOUS_EXTERNAL_NAMESPACES

```text
[AMBIGUOUS_EXTERNAL_NAMESPACES] Found ambiguous export.
   ╭─[ main.js:1:10 ]
   │
 1 │ import { T } from './barrel.js';
   │          ┬  
   │          ╰── "barrel.js" re-exports "T"
   │
   ├─[ a.js:1:10 ]
   │
 1 │ export { A as T } from 'ext';
   │          ┬  
   │          ╰── One matching export is here.
   │
   ├─[ b.js:1:10 ]
   │
 1 │ export { B as T } from 'ext';
   │          ┬  
   │          ╰── One matching export is here.
───╯

```

